==Battleground==
*2 [[Dogenstein]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Mega Baa Baa]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*1 [[Ragin' Gory]] spawns after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Dark Dober]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Dogenstein]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**1 [[Tackey]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
**5 [[Mega Baa Baa]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
**2 [[Ragin' Gory|Ragin' Gories]] spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Similar to the previous Dark Dober stage, a lot of this level can be done with the power of Talented [[Dark Lazer]]. [[Cat Egg Pod]] is very helpful to have here, being able to tank for a while as well as deal high damage against Ragin' Gory, and [[Hitman Cat]] shreds Mega Baa Baa. Once you stall the initial Ragin' Gory for cash, start spamming Dark Lazer. Your horde should be able to demolish Dark Dober before the stage gets too annoying.

==Trivia==
*Based on the theming of [[Konjac Valley]], Phantom Bluebird's name may refer to the original logo of the social media site [[wikipedia:Twitter|Twitter]], a blue bird.
**The enemies in the stage and its background (the dark forest from [[Le'Grim Strikes]]) could represent the new logo, a white X against a black background.
**The word 'Phantom' could suggest that the Twitter logo (bluebird) has been replaced by the X logo, referencing the 2023 rebranding of [[wikipedia:Twitter|Twitter]] to 'X' under [[wikipedia:Elon Musk|Elon Musk's]] ownership.

